AirTraffic was inspired by esp32flight (https://github.com/CrassusXY/esp32flight),
also MIT licensed. No esp32flight source code is included; the ideas of a
standalone desk flight radar on an ESP32 and the use of the free community
ADS-B feeds come from that project.

